{"evt":"note_created","id":"note-mqa16klgs77","workspace":"/Users/imyu/Desktop/zonoid","title":"resolveOwner / task-to-transcript attribution: assignee agent record has no session or transcript_path — use byWindow time-window overlap as third-leg fallback","summary":"When implementing resolveOwner(taskKey, registry) for task-to-transcript path resolution: a direct + sessionTranscript-only resolver misses ~40% of tasks where the assignee agent record has neither session nor transcript_path. All three legs must be attempted in order: (1) registry.agents[agentId].transcript_path directly, (2) registry.sessionTranscript[registry.agents[agentId].session], (3) time-window overlap against registry.byWindow — pick the run whose [start,end] interval overlaps the task's registry.window[taskKey] with the largest overlap (overlap = min(ends)-max(starts), value >= 0 counts). Missing end widens to now(). CORRECT PATTERN: for (const run of registry.byWindow) { const o = Math.min(taskEnd, runEnd||now) - Math.max(taskStart, runStart); if (o >= 0 && o > best) best = o, result = run.transcript_path }. Do NOT return null after failing legs 1 and 2 without trying byWindow. The registry shape always includes window and byWindow fields for this reason.","created_by":"main","valid_from":"2026-06-11T21:49:58.853Z","vec":[-0.0691172331571579,-0.033621590584516525,-0.04170074686408043,-0.02609703689813614,-0.05730249360203743,0.07316228747367859,0.018233781680464745,0.0603271946310997,-0.004668477922677994,-0.022260241210460663,-0.09521450847387314,-0.012043400667607784,-0.034800153225660324,0.04905174300074577,-0.0010862755589187145,0.016445999965071678,0.016118448227643967,-0.049333784729242325,-0.034647684544324875,-0.07966937124729156,0.10340448468923569,0.018135860562324524,0.0902373269200325,0.044604573398828506,-0.04243567958474159,0.0198256503790617,-0.06520035117864609,-0.099697545170784,0.05701093375682831,0.025136152282357216,0.038916606456041336,0.03664224594831467,-0.037584252655